## 2. Description of Service

Cipher is a desktop password manager that stores encrypted credential data locally, gated behind a physical USB security device ("Security Key"). Access to your vault requires:

- Physical possession of your registered Security Key, and
- Your account code and/or master credentials.

Cipher LLC does **not** operate servers that store your vault, passwords, or account code. All vault data is encrypted and stored either on the Security Key itself or, in demo/simulation modes, locally on your device. We have no ability to access, recover, or reset your vault contents.

